  "validity": "a run counts only if: QC ok and every generation divided; each clamped factor's bound fraction within 0.05 of its target (exactly 0 for a factor held off); in the fit arms, growth within 1.5-fold of the condition's fitted rate. Otherwise it is discarded, listed with its reasons, and never averaged. An arm left with fewer than two valid seeds reports no contrast.",
